From 23f2b9b42a66c954e5b35d519af15d7e89c64fb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:13:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/25] No supporter features, donation or author links

This build is a fork; the app carries nothing that points to the original
author's support channels:

- Settings' footer: the "Support Me" button and its dialog (QR codes,
  Ko-fi, Afdian, Patreon, WeChat, PayPal, crypto addresses) are gone, and
  so are the Discord and A2Tools.app buttons next to it.
- Supporters: no gold names (the roster is neither fetched nor read from
  a local override, and the "Show supporter colours" toggle is gone), no
  "Supporter" after the account's name, and no supporter-only bar
  textures (the texture and texture-offset rows are gone).
- Advanced: no "Send Logs to Dev".
- No one-time popup advertising an a2tools.app account at start.
- The version in Settings opens this fork's releases.

The scripts that drove these find nothing to bind to and do nothing. The
online features themselves stay (account, uploads, shared boss timers,
Discord status, the A2 tag in a party).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBQati3x8VviBbpY9juEWf
